                "loc": "ISA.40.19"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Is 40:19",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mufuzi ulacicita, ulacifula mumalasa, ulacibumbya insando akucipanga akuboko kwakwe kuyumu. Wafwa inzala mane lumwi wati wizuke. Tanywi maanzi, aboobo wakataala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.44.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.44.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 44:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mubezi ulavungulula intambo yakweelesya, ulaceenga-enga acisila, ulacibumbya cipazyo, ulaceenga-enga mumubalo, ulacibumba mucinkonzya camuntu, ceebeke mbuli muntu, cikale muŋanda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.44.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.44.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 44:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ulagonka misamu yakedari nanka kulibwezela musamu wakupresi na mubanga, umene akuba muyumu akati kamisamu yamulusaka. Ulazikila musamu wakedari, kuti imvula iulele. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.44.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.44.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 44:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lino ulabeda muntu inkuni. Ulabweza zimwi zyakuyota, azimwi ulazitenta kuti ajisye insima, lino zimwi ulazicitya Leza akuukomba, ulabeza, cikozyano akucikotamina. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.44.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.44.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 44:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cipanzi cimwi ulacitenta mumulilo, cipanzi cimwi ulacijisya nyama. Ulayoka nyama, ulakuta, Ulayota, ulaamba kuti, Ehe! Ndakasaalilwa, ndabona mulilo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
