        {
          "text": "Mbuboobu mbwaamba Jehova Mununuzi wako, ngonguwe iwakakubumba mwida. Ndime Jehova iwakalenga zintu zyoonse. Ndime endike ndakatandabika ijulu. Ndime ndakabambasika nyika. Nguni ngutwakali awe? ",
