        {
          "text": "Ndime uusimpya lusinizyo lwamajwi aamulanda wakwe akuzuzikizya lulayo lwabatumwa bakwe, uuambila Jerusalemu kuti, Uyoekalwa, akwaamba aaminzi yacisi ca-Juda kuti, Iyooyakululwa, amatongo aayo njooabukulusya; ",
